  "outstanding": [
    "The global existence theorem for abelian extensions with prescribed open finite-index idèle-class norm subgroup and the global reciprocity theorem identifying the norm quotient are retained foundational inputs. Their selected pinned theorems and the use of uniformizers in their local normalization are recorded. The cocycle extension over the infinite cyclotomic kernel and the dual cokernel formula are handled in INP-16 and INP-17."
  ]
}
